---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Hero from '../components/Hero.astro';
import Cta from '../components/Cta.astro';
---
<Base title={"Contact"} description={"Contact Valley Capital Partners."}>
<Hero eyebrow={"Contact"} title={"Speak with a principal."} lead={"We respond to every inquiry directly."} />
<main id="main">
<section class="section"><div class="wrap intro">
  <div><p class="eyebrow">Reach us</p><h2>The simplest way to start is a short email or a call.</h2>
    <div class="body"><p>Tell us who you are and, in a sentence or two, about the loan or the property. A principal will reply and arrange a time to talk.</p>
    <p>If you would like a confidentiality agreement in place first, say so and we will send one before you share anything further.</p></div></div>
  <dl class="direct" style="margin-top:0">
    <div><dt>Acquisitions</dt><dd><a href="mailto:acquisitions@valleycapitalpartner.com">acquisitions@valleycapitalpartner.com</a></dd></div>
    <div><dt>Confidentiality</dt><dd class="small">Information you send is used only to evaluate the loan or the property. We do not contact borrowers, guarantors, brands, or hotel staff without the consent of the party that sent it.</dd></div>
  </dl>
</div></section>
</main>
</Base>
